	<key>readme</key>
	<string># 🍷 Alfred Emoji Wine

✨ *Find the most refined emojis* ✨

## ✅ Prerequisites

* macOS and **Alfred 6** with the [Powerpack](https://www.alfredapp.com/powerpack/).
* **Python 3.8** or above (`python3 --version`). No other dependency: icons are rendered with the macOS built-in tools.

## 🧙‍♂️ Usage

1. Type `wine` and press ⏎ on **No API detected** to download the emojis in your language.
2. Type `wine` and search an emoji.
   * ⏎ copies it, ⌘⏎ pastes it, ⇧⏎ opens its dictionary page (all configurable). A deactivated shortcut does nothing.
3. **Tags**, **API information** and **Refresh the API** are always at the top of `wine` (`wine &gt;` opens the same menu): create custom tags and link them to emojis.
   ⏎ or ⇥ to go forward, **Return** to go back one level, **Back to search** to search emojis, and type to filter or to name a tag.

Alfred posts the notifications itself (end of a refresh, errors), with the `🎷 Notification sound`.

You can edit the trigger (flagged with 🕹️) and every other option in the user configuration panel.

## 📚 Documentation

Go to the dedicated [GitHub repository](https://github.com/BenjaminOddou/alfred-emoji-wine) page to check the documentation.

© Benjamin Oddou
